window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The third book in the Shadow World: The Vampire Debt series </p> <p>Clara and Alaric make their way to Nightwich to make an appearance before the queen in the heart of the vampire court. Surrounded by vampires, they must make them all believe Clara bears the mark of her vampire master. She must quickly learn to play by the rules set by the Vampire Queen. But games have never been more deadly.</p>"; 
